  <description value="A laboratory result describes the result of a laboratory analysis. These are specimen-oriented tests as performed in laboratories such as Clinical Chemistry, Serology, Microbiology, etc. In addition to the results of tests with a singular result, this concept can also contain the results of more complex tests with multiple results or a ‘panel’." />
  <purpose value="This Observation profile is derived from the http://nictiz.nl/fhir/StructureDefinition/nl-core-LaboratoryTestResult profile for Observation for the purposes of transactions specified in Lab2Healthcare and Lab2Patient information standards. The main factor differentiating this from its base profile is the addition of a reference to the lab-specific ServiceRequest profile on the basedOn element, which allows data about the requester and the request itself to be exchanged." />
